"description":"*** Winner of App Store's Best Game Award***\n- Walkr combines your phone’s pedometer with a fun galaxy adventure game!\n- Up to 100+ fascinating planets and 30+ mission goals that motivates you to walk more\n- Thanks to the support of our over 3,000,000+ iOS players in Walkr!\n\nWalkr is the second offering in a series of health-conscious games from SPARKFUL, creators of the Plant Nanny app with more than 30 million players! Hop on the Walkr spaceship and begin your adventure across the boundless cosmos!\n\n= KEEP UP GOOD WALKING HABITS =\n- With Walkr in your pocket, your daily steps are automatically recorded and converted into energy fuel for your spaceship\n- Tracks and records the amount of calories you burn and recommends daily fitness goals\n- Start up the booster when you begin walking to accumulate even more energy fuel\n\n= EXPLORE THE BOUNDLESS UNIVERSE =\n- Encourages you to stay active with up to 100+ fascinating planets and 30+ mission goals\n- Build your own collection of unique planets, spacefoods, and rare elements in the ever-expanding universe\n- Undertake missions to help adorable creatures from across the galaxy find their way back home\n\n= GET SOCIAL =\n- Invite friends to become your co-pilot and receive extra energy fuel\n- Join a fleet, and start your adventure with other captains for even more rewards\n- Visit the Planet Lab with friends to share energy fuel and unlock amazing planet wonders\n- Compete with friends from Comet to Galaxy League and grow together\n\n＊Walkr uses the iPhone’s m7/m8 to record your movements accurately with minimal battery consumption. \n＊Walkr uses a design that consumes the least amount of power. If you use a mobile phone below iPhone 5, running GPS in the background can record your walking more accurately. However, it may still reduce the battery life. You can go to \"Settings\"> \"Walkr\" on your phone to stop the \"Location\" function of Walkr.\n\nAny problems or suggestions? We would love to hear from you! \nFind us on Facebook: https://link.sparkful.app/facebook\nOr visit us: https://sparkful.app/walkr \n\n--\nTry a SPARKFUL subscription to help you build healthy habits while having fun. Subscribe to unlock all SPARKFUL apps and spark the fun in your daily routine. Subscription fees are US$7.99 monthly.\nAfter confirming your subscription, you'll begin a 7-day free trial. After the trial period App Store will begin automatically deducting the fee. Once your subscription term comes to an end, your plan will automatically renew. Free trials are limited to 1 per Apple account. Unused trial periods cannot be refunded.\n--\n\nPrivacy Policy and Term of Service: https://sparkful.app/legal/terms", "bundleId":"com.fourdesire.spacewalk", "trackCensoredName":"Walkr - Gamified Fitness Walk", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/walkr-gamified-fitness-walk/id834805518?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "sellerUrl":"https://sparkful.app/walkr", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.59048000000000033793412512750364840030670166015625, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "JA", "KO", "ZH", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"433864704", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":630, "trackContentRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4.59048000000000033793412512750364840030670166015625, "userRatingCount":630}]
